    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 Reaper's the page of the Goddess of Death, Shilen. Reaper's in charge of collecting the countless souls who wander about on earth, and bringing them to the underground world of Shilen. His loyalty to Shilen's absolute, and he stays close to the Seal of Shilen in order to serve the goddess better. He diligently carries out his duty while waiting for the day of the goddess' resurrection. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% HP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 MP Increase (1x) Lv. 1 Average P. Atk. Lv. 11 Average M. Atk. Lv. 11 Average P. Def. Lv. 11 Average M. Def. Lv. 11 Standard Type Lv. 2 Normal P. Def. and Evasion. One-handed Blunt Weapons Lv. 5 Blunt Weapons Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
